<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">claude</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> skill</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> install</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> github:bahayonghang/academic-writing-skills/dist/latex-paper-en.skill.zip</span></span>
